175.jpg?v=1586309766 400w" alt="Impact canopy barrier sign" title="Impact canopy barrier sign" class="sc-qZtVr dLIPjF pf-f8a250f0" data-pf-type="Image2"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-aee1d2d3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-f189aee1">BARRIER SIGN</span></h3><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-33debcc7"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-e5e533de">Grab the attention of potential customers with a custom designed, eye catching Barrier Sign. Free standing, the Barrier Sign offers an easy to use, portable storefront, exhibition display or for crowd control. The Barrier sign is maintenance free and the single or double sided graphic can be changed easily to match your current promotional campaign. Constructed from heavy duty 1″ carbon kevlar frames, the Barrier sign is lightweight, portable, durable and stable in most weather conditions.</span></p></div></div><div class="sc-pbYdQ jklmHY pf-c pf-c-xs--12 pf-c-sm--4 pf-c-md--4 pf-c-lg--4"><div class="sc-pkUyL fTyjzF pf-db595163" data-pf-type="Column"><img sizes="(min-width: 992px) 1200px, (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px) 800px, 400px" srcset="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-25a78887--fabric193x175.jpg?v=1586309858 1200w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-25a78887--fabric193x175.jpg?v=1586309858 800w, https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0260/9522/2843/t/3/assets/pf-25a78887--fabric193x175.jpg?v=1586309858 400w" alt="Impact canopy fabric banner" title="Impact canopy fabric banner" class="sc-qZtVr dLIPjF pf-bcc77c99" data-pf-type="Image2"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-oTLFK lcHmGL pf-c9c24060"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-66313493">FABRIC BANNERS<br></span></h3><p data-pf-type="Paragraph2" class="sc-pkvvt cbrLgP pf-4060db59"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-ptSuy fnmilh pf-263ec9c2">Maximize your branding space at minimal cost. Fabric Banners should 